        "url": "https://x.com/TeamCHIKAZ/status/1956742723131867315",
        "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/TeamCHIKAZ/status/1956742723131867315",
        "text": "\"𝑻𝒉𝒆 𝒅𝒂𝒓𝒌𝒆𝒓 𝒕𝒉𝒆 𝒏𝒊𝒈𝒉𝒕, 𝒕𝒉𝒆 𝒃𝒓𝒊𝒈𝒉𝒕𝒆𝒓 𝒕𝒉𝒆 𝒔𝒕𝒂𝒓𝒔 𝒔𝒉𝒊𝒏𝒆.\"\n\nWhat an eventful day it has been for us and our shining star, @_AZMartinez! And what beauty it is that the night brings to let stars shine their brightest. 🌟💫\n\nStealing one last look at AZ's LED billboard under a sky full of stars to cap off this dazzling day!\n\nTo Team CHIKAZ, may our love never waver. To @TeamAZOFC & @AZMATES_OFC, thank you for your hardwork and congratulations on a very successful event. To team bahay and online, thank you for tweeting with us all day. 💜🥹\n\nAZight IN EDSA\nUNFORGETTABLE RendAZvous\n#AzMartinez | AZ Martinez",
